          "Electrical overload and cistern night-leak detection",
          "Monthly reconciliation against official master bills (Sedapal and Luz del Sur)",
          "Cent-exact legal proration and digital settlement per unit",
          "12-month contract + 2-month service warranty",
          "BFF access for the administrator and web app for residents"
        ]
      },
